service password-encryption
no ip domain-lookup
ip domain-name {{ domain }}
enable secret CHANGE_ME_ENABLE
username admin privilege 15 secret CHANGE_ME_ADMIN
crypto key generate rsa modulus 2048
ip ssh version 2
banner motd ^Authorized access only^
